IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT domain
IMPORT `ind-a-tests-fixtures`
IMPORT `g1-adverse-action`
IMPORT `g1-register`

-- ind-a-tests-s10-s11.l4: independent tests by ind-a for s.10 (refusal to renew, revocation, restriction,
-- suspension) and s.11 (register).  Expected values decided before the encoding was opened
-- (work/ind-a/expectations.md, S10-*, S11-*).

§ `ind-a s.10 fixtures`

GIVEN g1 IS A BOOLEAN
      g2 IS A BOOLEAN
      g3 IS A BOOLEAN
      g4 IS A BOOLEAN
      g5 IS A BOOLEAN
      g6 IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `Grounds under section 10(a)`
`ind-a grounds` g1 g2 g3 g4 g5 g6 MEANS
    `Grounds under section 10(a)` WITH
        `the licence was granted on false, mistaken, misleading or partial information` IS g1
        `a condition for the grant ceased to hold` IS g2
        `the only condition that ceased to hold is a condition of section 6(a)(4)` IS FALSE
        `the licensee breached a licence condition` IS g3
        `the licensee breached a duty or prohibition under the Law or another enactment in connection with the activity as a licensee` IS g4
        `the licensee gave false, misleading, mistaken or partial information when it was demanded` IS g5
        `the licensee showed lack of professionalism or negligence that may endanger life or damage property` IS g6

`ind-a ground (1)` MEANS `ind-a grounds` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE
`ind-a no ground` MEANS `ind-a grounds` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE

GIVEN first IS A DATE
      last IS A DATE
GIVETH A MAYBE `Period of a restriction or suspension under section 10`
`ind-a period from` first `to` last MEANS
    JUST (`Period of a restriction or suspension under section 10` WITH `begins on` IS first, `ends on` IS JUST last)

GIVEN measure IS A `Measure under section 10(a)`
      grounds IS A `Grounds under section 10(a)`
      consulted IS A BOOLEAN
      hearing IS A BOOLEAN
      period IS A MAYBE `Period of a restriction or suspension under section 10`
GIVETH A `Circumstances of a measure under section 10(a)`
`ind-a measure` measure grounds consulted hearing period MEANS
    `Circumstances of a measure under section 10(a)` WITH
        `the measure` IS measure
        `the grounds` IS grounds
        `the Council was consulted` IS consulted
        `the Council's advice was validly given` IS consulted
        `the licensee was given an opportunity to make claims in writing` IS hearing
        `the period of the restriction or suspension` IS period

`ind-a one year from 2026-05-01` MEANS `ind-a period from` (YMD 2026 5 1) `to` (YMD 2027 5 1)

GIVEN indicted IS A BOOLEAN
      gravity IS A BOOLEAN
      consulted IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `Circumstances of a suspension under section 10(b)`
`ind-a indictment suspension` indicted gravity consulted MEANS
    `Circumstances of a suspension under section 10(b)` WITH
        `an indictment was filed against the licensee` IS indicted
        `in the Registrar's opinion the offence makes the licensee unfit to hold a licence` IS TRUE
        `the Registrar saw that the gravity of the matter or the public interest requires the suspension` IS gravity
        `the Council was consulted` IS consulted
        `the Council's advice was validly given` IS consulted
        `the licensee was given an opportunity to make claims in writing` IS TRUE

GIVEN curable IS A BOOLEAN
      consulted IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `Circumstances of a direction under section 10(c)`
`ind-a cure direction` curable consulted MEANS
    `Circumstances of a direction under section 10(c)` WITH
        `the grounds` IS `ind-a ground (1)`
        `the Registrar holds that the defect can be cured` IS curable
        `the Council was consulted` IS consulted
        `the Council's advice was validly given` IS consulted

-- A cure period of 30 days from a direction of 2026-03-10 (last day 2026-04-09); the measure is taken on the day given.
GIVEN cured IS A BOOLEAN
      `measure day` IS A DATE
GIVETH A `Circumstances of a measure after the cure period under section 10(c)`
`ind-a after the cure period` cured `measure day` MEANS
    `Circumstances of a measure after the cure period under section 10(c)` WITH
        `the measure under section 10(a)` IS `ind-a measure` `revoke the licence` `ind-a ground (1)` TRUE TRUE NOTHING
        `the period the Registrar set` IS (`Period fixed by the Registrar under section 10` WITH `the number of units` IS 30, `the unit` IS `a number of days fixed under section 10`, `counted from the day` IS YMD 2026 3 10)
        `the defect was cured to the satisfaction of the Registrar` IS cured
        `the day of the measure` IS `measure day`

§ `s.10(a)`

-- S10-01: each measure, ground (1), Council consulted, written hearing; restriction and suspension for one year.
#ASSERT `the Registrar may take the measure under section 10(a)` (`ind-a measure` `refuse to renew the licence` `ind-a ground (1)` TRUE TRUE NOTHING)
#ASSERT `the Registrar may take the measure under section 10(a)` (`ind-a measure` `make the renewal of the licence conditional on taking part in a training course under section 17` `ind-a ground (1)` TRUE TRUE NOTHING)
#ASSERT `the Registrar may take the measure under section 10(a)` (`ind-a measure` `revoke the licence` `ind-a ground (1)` TRUE TRUE NOTHING)
#ASSERT `the Registrar may take the measure under section 10(a)` (`ind-a measure` `restrict the licence` `ind-a ground (1)` TRUE TRUE `ind-a one year from 2026-05-01`)
#ASSERT `the Registrar may take the measure under section 10(a)` (`ind-a measure` `suspend the licence` `ind-a ground (1)` TRUE TRUE `ind-a one year from 2026-05-01`)
-- S10-02, S10-03, S10-04
#ASSERT NOT `the Registrar may take the measure under section 10(a)` (`ind-a measure` `revoke the licence` `ind-a ground (1)` FALSE TRUE NOTHING)
#ASSERT NOT `the Registrar may take the measure under section 10(a)` (`ind-a measure` `revoke the licence` `ind-a ground (1)` TRUE FALSE NOTHING)
#ASSERT NOT `the Registrar may take the measure under section 10(a)` (`ind-a measure` `revoke the licence` `ind-a no ground` TRUE TRUE NOTHING)
-- S10-05..10: each other ground alone.
#ASSERT `the Registrar may take the measure under section 10(a)` (`ind-a measure` `revoke the licence` (`ind-a grounds` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE) TRUE TRUE NOTHING)
#ASSERT `the Registrar may take the measure under section 10(a)` (`ind-a measure` `revoke the licence` (`ind-a grounds` FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE) TRUE TRUE NOTHING)
#ASSERT `the Registrar may take the measure under section 10(a)` (`ind-a measure` `revoke the licence` (`ind-a grounds` FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE) TRUE TRUE NOTHING)
#ASSERT `the Registrar may take the measure under section 10(a)` (`ind-a measure` `revoke the licence` (`ind-a grounds` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE) TRUE TRUE NOTHING)
#ASSERT `the Registrar may take the measure under section 10(a)` (`ind-a measure` `revoke the licence` (`ind-a grounds` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE) TRUE TRUE NOTHING)
-- S10-11: a suspension of 36 months (2026-05-01 to 2029-04-30) is within the cap.
#ASSERT `the Registrar may take the measure under section 10(a)` (`ind-a measure` `suspend the licence` `ind-a ground (1)` TRUE TRUE (`ind-a period from` (YMD 2026 5 1) `to` (YMD 2029 4 30)))
-- S10-12: 37 months exceeds; and a suspension to 2029-05-02 exceeds on any count.
#ASSERT NOT `the Registrar may take the measure under section 10(a)` (`ind-a measure` `suspend the licence` `ind-a ground (1)` TRUE TRUE (`ind-a period from` (YMD 2026 5 1) `to` (YMD 2029 5 31)))
#ASSERT NOT `the Registrar may take the measure under section 10(a)` (`ind-a measure` `suspend the licence` `ind-a ground (1)` TRUE TRUE (`ind-a period from` (YMD 2026 5 1) `to` (YMD 2029 5 2)))

§ `s.10(b)`

-- S10-13, S10-14, S10-15
#ASSERT `the Registrar may suspend the licence until final judgment` (`ind-a indictment suspension` TRUE TRUE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT `the Registrar may suspend the licence until final judgment` (`ind-a indictment suspension` TRUE FALSE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT `the Registrar may suspend the licence until final judgment` (`ind-a indictment suspension` FALSE TRUE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT `the Registrar may suspend the licence until final judgment` (`ind-a indictment suspension` TRUE TRUE FALSE)
-- S10-16: no three-year cap: still in force five years on with no judgment; ends with the judgment day.
#ASSERT `a suspension under section 10(b) is in force on the day` (YMD 2026 5 1) NOTHING (YMD 2031 5 1)
#ASSERT `a suspension under section 10(b) is in force on the day` (YMD 2026 5 1) (JUST (YMD 2031 9 1)) (YMD 2031 9 1)
#ASSERT NOT `a suspension under section 10(b) is in force on the day` (YMD 2026 5 1) (JUST (YMD 2031 9 1)) (YMD 2031 9 2)

§ `s.10(c)`

-- S10-17, S10-18: the direction needs the Council and a curable defect, not a hearing.
#ASSERT `the Registrar may direct that the licensee not do the specified work until the defect is cured` (`ind-a cure direction` TRUE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT `the Registrar may direct that the licensee not do the specified work until the defect is cured` (`ind-a cure direction` TRUE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT `the Registrar may direct that the licensee not do the specified work until the defect is cured` (`ind-a cure direction` FALSE TRUE)
-- S10-19, S10-20 (Council consulted and hearing given; no rest days)
#ASSERT `the Registrar may take the measure after the cure period` (`ind-a after the cure period` FALSE (YMD 2026 4 10)) `ind-a no rest days`
#ASSERT NOT `the Registrar may take the measure after the cure period` (`ind-a after the cure period` TRUE (YMD 2026 4 10)) `ind-a no rest days`
#ASSERT NOT `the Registrar may take the measure after the cure period` (`ind-a after the cure period` FALSE (YMD 2026 4 9)) `ind-a no rest days`

§ `s.10(d)`

-- S10-21
#ASSERT null (`the preconditions of section 10(d) for the bar not met` (`Circumstances of a bar after revocation under section 10(d)` WITH `the licence was revoked under section 10(a)` IS TRUE, `the Council was consulted` IS TRUE, `the Council's advice was validly given` IS TRUE))
#ASSERT `the Registrar may add conditions to the grant of a new licence` (`Circumstances of a bar after revocation under section 10(d)` WITH `the licence was revoked under section 10(a)` IS TRUE, `the Council was consulted` IS TRUE, `the Council's advice was validly given` IS TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT `the Registrar may add conditions to the grant of a new licence` (`Circumstances of a bar after revocation under section 10(d)` WITH `the licence was revoked under section 10(a)` IS FALSE, `the Council was consulted` IS TRUE, `the Council's advice was validly given` IS TRUE)

§ `s.11 register`

`ind-a suspended licence` MEANS
    Licence WITH
        `the holder` IS `ind-a person`
        `the kind of licence` IS `grade 2 licence`
        `a temporary licence under section 9` IS FALSE
        `granted on` IS YMD 2025 9 1
        `renewed on` IS EMPTY
        `validity ends on, as recorded` IS JUST (YMD 2030 3 31)
        `revoked on` IS NOTHING
        `suspended from` IS JUST (YMD 2026 5 1)
        `suspended until` IS JUST (YMD 2027 5 1)

-- S11-01
#ASSERT (`s 11(a) — the register entry for the licence` `ind-a suspended licence`)'s `the kind of licence` EQUALS `grade 2 licence`
#ASSERT (`s 11(a) — the register entry for the licence` `ind-a suspended licence`)'s `the licence is valid until` EQUALS JUST (YMD 2030 3 31)
#ASSERT `s 11(a)(2) — the entry shows a suspension` (`s 11(a) — the register entry for the licence` `ind-a suspended licence`)
#ASSERT NOT `s 11(a)(2) — the entry shows a revocation` (`s 11(a) — the register entry for the licence` `ind-a suspended licence`)
-- S11-03: a query that states no identifying details is not one the register answers.
#ASSERT `s 11(b) — the register shows, on a query` (`Query of the register of licensees` WITH `identifying details of the person asked about were stated` IS FALSE, `the reference for the person asked about` IS "") (LIST `s 11(a) — the register entry for the licence` `ind-a suspended licence`) EQUALS LEFT `the query states no identifying details of the person asked about`
#ASSERT `s 11(b) — the register shows, on a query` (`Query of the register of licensees` WITH `identifying details of the person asked about were stated` IS TRUE, `the reference for the person asked about` IS "ind-a-person-1") (LIST `s 11(a) — the register entry for the licence` `ind-a suspended licence`) EQUALS RIGHT (LIST `s 11(a) — the register entry for the licence` `ind-a suspended licence`)
